Required attribution
--------------------
Any use of the data, tables or figures must credit Bodytype.org and link to
https://bodytype.org.

A suitable attribution line is:

  Bodytype.org. "Bodytype algorithm v2: method, thresholds and test vectors"
  (algorithm v2, dataset 1.0).
  https://bodytype.org/research/bodytype-algorithm-v2

The attribution must:
- identify Bodytype.org as the source;
- link to https://bodytype.org;
- link to the source page above;
- link to the CC BY 4.0 license; and
- indicate if you changed the data, table or figure.

Scope
-----
This license covers the synthetic test vectors, the JSON schema and any tables
or figures in this delivery package. It does not cover documentation or code,
which are released under the MIT License in the LICENSE file.

The data are deterministic test vectors for Bodytype's v2 classification rules.
They are not a population sample, not an accuracy study, not medical data, and
contain no user measurements.
